tengine/godot/issues/113958#issuecomment-3656922665","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113958","id":3656922665,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Z-DYp","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-15T18:00:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-15T18:00:50Z","body":"Yes, the debug builds are the result of building with the arguments in the reproduction step.\n\nI'm not using `dev_build=yes`. I'm using the same command described in the documentation, but adding `swappy=true` and for a single architecture `arch=arm64` since I don't need all four, so it's a single command I use to build the editor:\n```\nscons platform=android arch=arm64 production=yes swappy=true target=editor generate_android_binaries=yes\n```\nWhich should generate a release build, but it generates debug builds instead.\n\nBuilding multiple architectures or removing swappy still outputs these debug builds.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3656922665/reactions","total_count":