gine/godot/issues/comments/3656956235","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113958#issuecomment-3656956235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113958","id":3656956235,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Z-LlL","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-15T18:09:30Z","updated_at":"2025-12-15T18:09:30Z","body":"I'm not using it too. These are the arguments for the CI of the Godot repository, but `dev_mode` shouldn't generate debug builds, right? It triggers stricter compilation, but it should still be generating a production build.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3656956235/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3656983897","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113958#issuecomment-3656983897","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113958","id":3656983897,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Z-SVZ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-15T18:16:46Z","updated_at":"2025-12-15T18:16:57Z","body":"Android doesn't respect the naming of Godot release/debug builds. What is called \"release\" for the Android editor is a signed build made with `scons store_release=yes` and the following environment variables defined: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-build-scripts/blob/main/config.sh.in#L94-L100\n\nIn practice, this is only designed to be used by the Godot Foundation when making official releases for Google Play / Meta Horizon Store.\n\nSo these `debug` binaries you got should still be production builds, just unsigned.\n\nCC @m4gr3d @syntaxerror247 ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3656983897/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]